vyatta-config-migrate (0.18) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Code-quality lint fixes (distro docs/porting.md): analyzer findings
    fixed, see the git log.
  * XorpConfigParser keeps unquoted "name: value" values, and ends
    instead of hanging on a comment left open at the end of a file.
  * XorpConfigMigrator.pl refuses an unknown --action instead of writing
    an empty config.
  * Tests for the parser, the migrators and vyatta_config_migrate.pl.
  * Depend on libnetaddr-ip-perl, which the migrators use.
  * Drop subnet_to_interface.pl and interface_to_subnet.pl, which nothing
    calls.

 -- NuDanOS Maintainers <jon@fernandez.tech>  Wed, 21 Oct 2026 07:01:13 +0000

